</script>
            </event>
            <keep intact="contentArea"/>
            <draw name="Text15" w="7.875in" h="111.125mm">
               <ui>
                  <textEdit/>
               </ui>
               <value>
                  <exData contentType="text/html">
                     <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Policy:</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in">Graduate and Credential students must have completed at least one semester of coursework, while in residence at Cal State Fullerton in order to qualify for a leave. Leave requests should be submitted before the first day of classes for the semester being requested</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Leave requests for two consecutive semesters and any medical leave requests require appropriate substantial documentation detailing the circumstances that make it impossible or inadvisable to register for classes (e.g. doctor’s note, employer’s verification, etc.). A leave of absence is normally not granted for longer than two consecutive semesters. An approved leave does not extend the time limit imposed by the State for completing degree or credential requirements. It also does not exempt students from new credential requirements imposed by the State regardless of catalog year.</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Grounds for requesting a leave of absence include:</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">      </span>-<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal">Illness or disability (permanent or temporary) or similar personal exigencies including pregnancy that makes it impossible or<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span></span></p><p style="letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">        </span>inadvisable for a student to register for classes</p><p style="letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">      </span>- Activities that enhance a student’s professional career objectives</p><p style="letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">      </span>- Active duty in the armed forces of the United States</p><p style="letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">      </span>- Severe financial hardship</p><p style="letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">      </span>- Other reasons at the discretion of the appropriate graduate administrator or their designee<span style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline"><br/></span><br/></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">A leave of absence is not granted in order for a student to take coursework at a community college or other university for financial or academic reasons.</p></body>
                  </exData>
               </value>
               <font typeface="Myriad Pro"/>
               <margin topInset="0.5mm" bottomInset="0.5mm" leftInset="0.5mm" rightInset="0.5mm"/>
